-open failure, it returns hard error instead of fallback.\n  - Repo open uses go-git in OpenRepository in strategy/common.go (/Users/alisha/Projects/wt/kiro-agent/cmd/entire/cli/strategy/common.go:595), which fails\n    on worktreeconfig extension in this environment.\n\n  Impact\n\n  - Hook failures during normal Claude usage in affected local setups.\n  - Appears user-specific depending on local git metadata/config.\n\n  Workaround\n  Disable the extension:\n\n  git config --unset extensions.worktreeConfig\n\n  Re-enable later if needed:\n\n  git config extensions.worktreeConfig true\n\n  Notes\n  This is likely a go-git compatibility gap with repository extensions, surfaced in Entire because UserPromptSubmit depends on go-git status lookup.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n_No response_\n\n### Entire CLI version\n\nlocal dev run via go run ./cmd/entire/main.go\n\n### OS and architecture\n\nmac os 26.3 (25D125)\n\n### Agent\n\nClaude Code\n\n### Terminal\n\nghostty\n\n### Logs / debug output\n\n```bash\n\n```\n\n### Additional context\n\n_No response_","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ee057b17-0fdc-41fb-bd5a-e3f0c2d0ff5f","timestamp":"2026-05-08T14:40:59.736Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"title:\tClaude hooks fail in git worktree repos when extensions.worktreeConfig=true\nstate:\tCLOSED\nauthor:\talishakawaguchi\nlabels:\tbug\ncomments:\t4\nassignees:\talishakawaguchi\nprojects:\t\nmilestone:\t\nnumber:\t546\n--\n### What happened?\n\nHooks fails in git worktree repos when extensions.worktreeConfig=true\n\n  Summary\n  In a git worktree, Entire’s Claude UserPromptSubmit hook fails before prompt processing when repo config contains extensions.worktreeConfig=true. This\n  causes the hook error banner in Claude Code.\n\n  Environment\n\n  - Entire CLI: local dev run via go run ./cmd/entire/main.go\n  - Claude Code: v2.1.59\n  - Git: 2.53.0\n  - Repo type: git worktree (.git is a gitdir pointer)\n\n  Steps To Reproduce\n\n  1. In a worktree-based repo, enable:\n\n     git config