{"parentUuid":"ece5e674-226e-47ea-b819-f7daf34e0ebf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01Y8e2PZwEXQcd6FLCBbEzDE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 1. Existing issues\n\nNo exact match. Closest related but different root:\n- #1137 — sentinel timeout (file exists, sentinel missing)\n- #546 — worktree + `extensions.worktreeConfig` go-git failure\n- #686 / #784 / #768 — missing `Entire-Checkpoint` trailer (downstream symptom; different cause)\n\nWorth filing new bug.\n\n## 2. Why it happens\n\nClaude Code worktree feature mismatch between `transcript_path` reported and actual file location.\n\n**Verified on disk:**\n\n```\nhook payload says: ~/.claude/projects/-Users-matthiaswenz-Development-matthiaswenz-activity--claude-worktrees-agents-no-squash/e0c25dfd-...jsonl\n                                                                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nfile actually at: ~/.claude/projects/-Users-matthiaswenz-Development-matthiaswenz-activity/e0c25dfd-...jsonl\n```\n\nClaude Code:\n- creates git worktree at `<repo>/.claude/worktrees/<branch>/`\n- spawns agent with CWD inside that worktree\n- reports `transcript_path` encoded from the **worktree CWD** (`SanitizePathForClaude` of full worktree path)\n- but **stores transcript file under the main repo's project dir** (parent path without `.claude/worktrees/<branch>` suffix)\n\nCode path in CLI (`cmd/entire/cli/agent/claudecode/lifecycle.go:135` → `cmd/entire/cli/lifecycle.go:392`):\n\n```go\ntranscriptRef := event.SessionRef            // = raw.TranscriptPath, trusted verbatim\n...\nif !fileExists(transcriptRef) {\n    return fmt.Errorf(\"transcript file not found: %s\", transcriptRef)\n}\n```\n\n`waitForTranscriptFlush` also early-returns when `os.Stat` fails (`lifecycle.go:213-218`), so `PrepareTranscript` never recovers.\n\n**Cascade:** TurnEnd handler aborts before `SaveStep`/condense → no shadow-branch commit, no `entire/checkpoints/v1` entry, no `Entire-Checkpoint` trailer added by `prepare-commit-msg` (no checkpoint id to inject) → user sees plain commits.\n\n## 3. Proposed fix\n\nAdd transcript-path fallback resolver in claudecode agent. Two layers:\n\n**A. Agent-specific resolver** (`cmd/entire/cli/agent/claudecode/claude.go`):\n\nNew method `ResolveTranscript(sessionRef, sessionID string) string`:\n1. If `fileExists(sessionRef)` → return as-is.\n2. If sessionRef path contains `--claude-worktrees-` segment → strip from `--claude-worktrees-...` to end, rebuild path, check exists.\n3. Final fallback: scan `~/.claude/projects/*/<sessionID>.jsonl`, return first match.\n4. None found → return original (let caller error normally).\n\n**B. Lifecycle integration** (`cmd/entire/cli/lifecycle.go`):\n\nBefore `fileExists` check, call resolver if agent implements new `TranscriptResolver` interface; update `event.SessionRef` to resolved path; log info-level redirect for diagnostics.\n\nWhy agent-layer: this `.claude/worktrees` encoding quirk is CC-specific. Other agents shouldn't pay scan cost.\n\nAdd regression test in `claudecode/claude_test.go` covering: worktree path strip, base-dir scan fallback, no-match passthrough.\n\nAlso worth: open upstream Claude Code bug — `transcript_path` should match actual storage path.\n\nWant me to implement?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2600,"cache_read_input_tokens":81673,"output_tokens":2196,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2600,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":2196,"cache_read_input_tokens":81673,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2600,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2600},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaqH8pcTZAGzQ